{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method is called as the currently displayed map camera changes as part of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an animation, whether due to a user gesture or due to a call to a method such","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/setCamera:animated:"},{"text":". This method can be called before","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapViewDidFinishLoadingMap:"},{"text":" is called.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"During the animation, this method may be called many times to report updates to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the viewpoint. Therefore, your implementation of this method should be as lightweight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as possible to avoid affecting performance.","type":"text"}]},{"level":4,"type":"heading","text":"Related examples","anchor":"Related-examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TODO: Cluster point data, learn how to trigger an action whenever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the map region changes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNMapView","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapView"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/Ma